{"date":"2025-03-17","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_1db65465399497c84e24a83832b7bfb8","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1742203800,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-03-14","chunk":0,"id":"m_ba79978fa770e0d2c71cc279c6bc7543"}}},{"id":"m_0e30dbd62edc22fec9e292944753da8d","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1742203837,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b7a154094ad3c3099e82d8b87de2bb7a","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1742203874,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b8ebb69ee9ef2121cd820d09977e5fff","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1742203911,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_201ccd360ede89bb2252a490be3a110b","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1742203948,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_5b4e2f1bc68a7b13b2fa110be653bdd1","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1742203985,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_83835781a4996fdc43d4a4b1ac49b0a5","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1742204022,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_537fbaf493a1f58e2eddf14465bd68c2","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1742204059,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2ac955b80f1f16592e20323d012b44ae","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1742204096,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_0f53c0abec91560d5cc37c5901aab222","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1742204133,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f0a8b929d59ac485866a9024555a511b","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1742204170,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_e05c79d435fb8c0eb35ffc92acbbe1a0","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1742204207,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_3b960ee6109648e1e602105fc022bec3","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1742204244,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c39649e201e740cd56088a1e3d9862f5","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1742204281,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_8ca5562a4eda8b3f6018c47af348f60d","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1742204318,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_66896f2d586ddb650cb667b455defce1","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1742204355,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_3cbfba44539aecf958dd69f3a49f162f","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1742204392,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_851a6c944a1c69dbc8638af2713ec339","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1742204429,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_84ef6a6a06842b4daba2b3bdacaa515b","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1742204466,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7f92f3b6b279024c6146e9a883c81fb6","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1742204503,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_95eab1738e30a554d99108b92551789c","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1742204540,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d2b6d5179ed510c41d2b4b6deb94f545","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1742204577,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_bdec343863ac71df7bcb4a61480a375f","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1742204614,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e0fda794b82317c18a4f58ccd714b0f7","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1742204651,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
